            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ошибка — не повод обнулять всё. Просто отметь и иди дальше.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A slip is no reason to throw it all away. Just mark it and keep going."
